C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\harness-document-specialist.md:12:Responsible for: project doc lookup, external doc lookup, API/framework reference research, package evaluation, version compatibility, source synthesis, literature/paper research.
