C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:13:# Socket Action Pattern (outpos-client-agent)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:15:> 원칙: 모든 외부 통신은 `action` enum + `requestId` envelope + `_pendingRequests` Completer 매칭 3종 세트로 동작한다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:17:> 적용 대상: Flutter outpos-client-agent (Dart 3.9 / Riverpod / Drift)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:23:- 소켓당 Action enum 2쌍을 정의한다 (`*ServerAction` 수신용, `*ClientAction` 송신용).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:24:- 모든 Action은 `SocketAction` 추상 인터페이스를 구현하며 `action` getter로 문자열을 노출한다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:25:- 페이로드는 `{ requestId, action, data }` envelope, 응답은 `{ requestId, action: Response|RESPONSE, results, error, status }`.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:26:- 수신 측은 `_handleMessage` (or `_handleServerMessage`) 1개에서 `switch (action)` 한 번에 분기한다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:27:- 송신 측은 `_pendingRequests: Map<String, Completer>`에 requestId를 걸고 timeout으로 언락.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:31:- `lib/src/Common/Enums/action/poslink/poslink_server_action.dart`
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:37:- `lib/src/Common/Background/pos_link_socket_background_service.dart`
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:38:- `lib/src/Common/Background/tableorder_server_background_service.dart`
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:47:   - 외부 → 에이전트 수신: `*ServerAction` enum에 값 추가 (예: `PosLinkServerAction`)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:56:   - 수신 Action이면 `_handleServerMessage` (또는 `_handleMessage`)의 `switch` 문에 case 1줄 + private 메서드 1개 추가
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:57:   - dispatch 등록 없이 메서드만 추가하면 dead code. `_extOrder`가 이 사례다 (아래 Gotchas 참조)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:58:5. **DTO + Service + Queue 체인**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:59:   - `SocketAction 수신 → private 메서드 → Queue 등록 → Service 호출 → HTTP/Drift → Response` 순서 고정
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:60:   - Queue를 거치지 않고 Service를 직접 호출하는 것은 race 유발. `order_queue_manager.dart` 패턴 따를 것
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:63:   - 도메인 에러: `*.error(requestId, errorType)` — `ErrorType`은 `status`, `message`, `error` 3필드
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:64:   - 예외: `*.exception(requestId, e)` — 내부적으로 `status=9999999`, `error=EtcError.UnknownError`
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:69:   - 송신 측 `*ClientAction._action` 문자열과 수신 측 `*ServerAction._action` 문자열이 일치해야 함
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:72:   - `_handleServerMessage`에서 `fromString<PosLinkServerAction>(json['action'])`처럼 수신측 enum으로 파싱해야 함
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:75:   - `pos_link_socket_background_service.dart:403-422` 스타일의 switch에서 `_ => throw CustomException(SocketError.NotSupportedAction)` 기본 분기 관찰
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:79:   - 예: `PosLinkServerAction.EXT_ORDER`는 dispatch 등록되어 있지만 `_extOrder` 메서드 내부는 `_extPayment`와 거의 동일 — study/21-easypos.md §1 확인
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:85:   - 동일 밀리초에 동일 action을 2회 호출 시 충돌 가능 (이론상). Counter를 섞는 편이 안전
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:87:   - Completer가 complete 되기 전에 소켓이 끊기면 `.future`가 영원히 대기
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:90:   - `PosLinkSocketBackgroundService.sendMessage`는 `Duration(seconds: 1)` 타임아웃 → 너무 짧음. 서버 응답 지연 시 false positive
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:91:   - `agent_client_background_service`는 자체 정책. 신규 Action 설계 시 응답 SLA 기준으로 결정
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:93:   - Queue를 거치는 경우(`OrderQueueManager`)는 직렬 보장됨
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:94:   - Queue 없이 Service 직접 호출은 `Future` 순서가 `microtask` 순서에 의존 → 직렬성 보장 없음
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:110:- `action`: `Response` (AgentServer 계열) 또는 `RESPONSE` (PosLink 계열) — 2가지 표기 혼재
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:112:- `error`: `ErrorInfo { code }` (에러일 때만)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:122:6. `Result.isError`면 `*.error(requestId, result.error!)` 전송
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:124:8. `CustomException`은 `errorType` 꺼내서 `*.error(...)`, `Exception`은 `*.exception(...)`, `catch`는 `*.exception(...)` + MonitoringUtils 전송
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:128:- 송신: Completer 생성 → `_pendingRequests[requestId] = completer` → 소켓 send → `completer.future.timeout(...)`
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:130:- timeout: `_pendingRequests.remove(requestId)` + `Future.error(CustomException(SocketError.TimeOutError))`
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:136:- `success(requestId, results)`: action=RESPONSE, error=null, status="200"
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:137:- `error(requestId, errorType)`: action=RESPONSE, results=errorType.message, error=ErrorInfo(errorType.error), status=errorType.status
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\outpos-agent\socket-action-pattern.md:138:- `exception(requestId, exception)`: action=RESPONSE, results=exception.toString(), error=ErrorInfo(exception.toString()), status="9999999"
