C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:108:Process the doc line by line. Track the current line number. For each line:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:115:**Step 4: Verify each claim**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:116:For each extracted claim tuple, apply the verification method from `<claim_extraction>` for its category:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:121:- Dependency claims: check package.json dependencies fields
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:133:Create `.planning/tmp/` directory if it does not exist. Write the result to `.planning/tmp/verify-{doc_filename}.json` where `{doc_filename}` is the basename of `doc_path` with extension (e.g., `README.md` → `verify-README.md.json`).
