C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:139:Write one JSON file per doc with this exact shape:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:165:- `doc_path`: the value from `verify_assignment.doc_path` (verbatim — do not resolve to absolute path)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:166:- `claims_checked`: integer count of all claims processed (not counting skipped)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:167:- `claims_passed`: integer count of PASS results
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:168:- `claims_failed`: integer count of FAIL results (must equal `failures.length`)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-doc-verifier.md:171:After writing the JSON, return this single confirmation to the orchestrator:
