C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:306:   - NO: Bug is here
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:308:5. Find divergence point (where expected vs actual first differ)
