C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:322:**When:** Something used to work and now doesn't. Works in one environment but not another.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:326:- What changed in environment? (Node version, OS, dependencies)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:335:- Third-party service behavior
