C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:476:## What "Verified" Means
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:478:A fix is verified when ALL of these are true:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:480:1. **Original issue no longer occurs** - Exact reproduction steps now produce correct behavior
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:481:2. **You understand why the fix works** - Can explain the mechanism (not "I changed X and it worked")
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:486:**Anything less is not verified.**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:488:## Reproduction Verification
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:490:**Golden rule:** If you can't reproduce the bug, you can't verify it's fixed.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:493:**After fixing:** Execute the same steps exactly
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:500:- **Solution:** Revert fix. If bug comes back, you've verified fix addressed it.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:504:**The problem:** Fix one thing, break another.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:511:## Environment Verification
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:513:**Differences to consider:**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:515:- Dependencies (different package versions, system libraries)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:521:- [ ] Works in Docker (mimics production)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:527:**For intermittent bugs:**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-debugger.md:532:  npm test -- specific-test.js || echo "Failed on run $i"
