C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\research-stack-onboarder.md:83:- Do NOT write `skills/_pipeline/**`, overlays, golden_pin tests, or edit `cli/gen_pipeline_core_overlay._VARIANTS`. The CLI + operator own those.
