C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-reverse-prd.md:312:- vs `cli.reverse_engineer`: reverse-prd is the orchestrator; reverse_engineer is the per-extractor backend (convention/er/logical/openapi/...). reverse-prd composes them into staged PRD.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-reverse-prd.md:313:- vs `kha-new-project`: kha-new-project bootstraps `.planning/` for greenfield work; reverse-prd retro-fits PRD onto existing brownfield code.
