C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:20:### IF 신규 query engine 채택 (Plan)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:21:1. **default 권고: Trino** — Iceberg v2 spec 완전, Fault-Tolerant Execution(FTE) 보유, 빅테크 채택 다수(Netflix/Lyft/Stripe/Salesforce/LinkedIn — Starburst 2차 출처 명시)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:23:3. fork 식별 — repo URL이 `trinodb/trino` vs `prestodb/presto`, 버전 numbering(Trino 480+ vs PrestoDB 0.297) 두 가지로 구분
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:24:4. Iceberg 워크로드 → Trino (v2 equality delete, time-travel `FOR TIMESTAMP/VERSION AS OF`, branch/tag 모두 지원)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:26:### IF 다중 source federation (Implement)
