C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:28:2. Coordinator CBO가 join order 결정 — `trino.io/docs/current/optimizer/cost-based-optimizations.html` 통계 수집(`ANALYZE TABLE`) 의무
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:29:3. Network transfer 비용 — 작은 dim은 Iceberg, 큰 fact는 Hive에 두고 적절한 join hint
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:32:### IF FTE(Fault-Tolerant Execution, Trino 전용) 결정 (Plan)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:33:1. **batch/ETL 워크로드** → `retry-policy=TASK` + Exchange Manager(S3/HDFS spool) — Spark 대체 가능 영역
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:34:2. **interactive query** → `retry-policy=QUERY` 또는 retry 비활성 (latency 우선)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:39:2. broadcast hint 강제 시 driver/coordinator OOM 가능 — `distributed_join` session property로 강제 분산
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:44:- "Netflix가 Trino를 쓴다" 단정은 Starburst 등 2차 출처에서만 — Netflix 자체 tech blog 1차 출처는 Iceberg + Maestro 통합만 명시. **Iceberg가 Netflix 작품**이므로 Iceberg-first 워크로드는 Trino가 자연스럽다는 약한 표현이 안전.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\data\presto-trino-federation.md:52:| 기능 적합성 | Iceberg v2 equality delete 처리는 Trino full, PrestoDB 후행 |
