C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:44:3. **On convergence**:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:45:   - Report: "ralph converged at iteration X; all validators PASS."
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:46:   - Print `store.path` so the user can inspect events.
