C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:66:- final summary: pass/fail per validator at last iteration + total iterations + last failing diff (if `hard_cap`).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:67:- status: `all_pass` (every selected validator passed) | `hard_cap` (max-iter reached, some failing) | `aborted_no_validators` | `aborted_no_goal`.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:71:- **goal missing**: prompt user once for one-line goal; abort with `aborted_no_goal` on second empty.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:73:- **fix-agent error** (Agent tool exception, malformed diff, refused commit): retry the SAME iteration's fix once with the same prompt; second failure → log + skip to next iteration (do not infinite-loop on a broken fix).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:74:- **validator pass→fail regression** (iteration N+1 has fewer passing than N): preserve iteration N's commit but log regression event; continue if max-iter remaining.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:75:- **max-iter reached without all_pass**: status `hard_cap`. Per-validator fail diff preserved in `events.jsonl`. Already-committed fixes remain in git — manual review needed.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:79:- preflight: goal non-empty; selected validators all exist in `validators.VALIDATOR_NAMES`; max-iter > 0; project has clean git working tree (so per-iteration commits are isolatable).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:80:- success criteria: every selected validator passes at iteration ≤ max-iter.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:81:- abort triggers: goal missing after re-prompt; unknown validator; max-iter hit (escalates to user, not hard abort).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:85:- checkpoint: `state/ralph/<sid>/events.jsonl` — append-only per-iteration log. Resumable.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-ralph.md:87:- idempotent: per-iteration NO (each iteration produces new commits). Across re-runs: depends on git state — if prior commits address same issues, validators may pass on iteration 1.
