C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:2:name: flutter-ci-hotfix-canon
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:3:description: Flutter 3.x를 GitHub Actions에서 처음 굴릴 때 누적되는 13+가지 함정 카탈로그 — gradlew exec bit, build_runner, custom_lint AOT, dart format 버전 차이, strict raw type, Stream timeout 시그니처 등
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:4:keywords: flutter github-actions gradlew build_runner custom_lint dart-format inference_failure
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:6:paths: .github/workflows pubspec.yaml analysis_options.yaml
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:7:patterns: flutter pub dart build_runner custom_lint
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:9:tech-stack: flutter
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:13:# Flutter 3.x CI hotfix canon
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:15:> 핵심 원칙: Flutter CI는 **로컬 환경의 우연한 잘 됨**에 의존하지 않는다. Windows 개발 + Linux/macOS CI runner 사이의 모든 환경 차이 (filesystem, line ending, exec bit, Dart 버전, runner 가용성, network 의존) 가 한 번씩 깨진다. 본 카탈로그는 dual-order Stage 17 (13 hotfix) + I-5 + V-3에서 누적된 학습. 새 Flutter 프로젝트 시작 시 이 카탈로그를 첫 commit에 반영하면 cold-start cost가 0에 수렴.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:19:### IF 새 Flutter 프로젝트 CI 첫 설정 (Design)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:20:1. `.github/workflows/flutter.yml`을 ubuntu-22.04 기반으로 작성. macOS/Windows runner는 큐 22min+ 가능 → analyze/test 단계는 OS 무관이므로 ubuntu만 쓴다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:21:2. 첫 commit 전 `git update-index --chmod=+x gradlew`로 exec bit 박기 (Windows에서 만든 wrapper는 666 이라 Linux runner에서 exit 126).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:22:3. `pubspec.yaml`에 `custom_lint` / `riverpod_lint` 추가 X (IDE assist 용도면 dev dep도 X — CI AOT fail 함정).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:23:4. workflow에 `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs` 단계 명시. `*.freezed.dart` / `*.g.dart`은 `.gitignore`에 (commit 안 함).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:24:5. `dart format`은 `--output=none --set-exit-if-changed`보다 advisory (continue-on-error) — 로컬 Dart 버전과 CI Flutter stable Dart 버전이 종종 다름.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:25:6. `dart analyze --fatal-warnings` 까지만. `--fatal-infos`는 `withOpacity` deprecated 같은 minor info에 매번 fail.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:30:   - `Could not find a file named ".freezed.dart"` → build_runner 단계 누락
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:31:   - `inference_failure_*` warning → 명시 type argument 누락 (§strict raw type)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:32:   - `analyzer_plugin AOT failed` → custom_lint/riverpod_lint dev dep 충돌
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:37:- `gh auth refresh -s workflow -h github.com` + `gh auth setup-git`. `.github/workflows/**` push에는 OAuth `workflow` scope 필수.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:39:## 함정 카탈로그 (dual-order 누적 학습)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:47:| 1 | `gradlew` exit 126 (Linux runner) | Windows에서 commit하면 exec bit 누락 (filesystem mode bit 666) | `git update-index --chmod=+x gradlew && git commit -m "fix: gradlew exec bit"` 한 번이면 영구 해결 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:48:| 2 | `gradle/wrapper-validation` ETIMEDOUT | services.gradle.org Cloudflare 외부 의존 — 지역/시점에 따라 fail | `continue-on-error: true` (supply-chain 검증은 advisory로) |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:49:| 3 | macOS/Windows runner queue 22min+ | GitHub Actions에서 분당 가용 분량 부족 | `runs-on: ubuntu-22.04`. analyze/test/build은 OS 무관 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:55:| 4 | `freezed ^2.5.7` ↔ `custom_lint ^0.6.4` 충돌 | analyzer 버전 graph 불일치 | `custom_lint ^0.7.1`로 시도 → 그래도 analyzer_plugin AOT fail → IDE-assist용은 dev dep도 제거 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:56:| 5 | `*.freezed.dart` / `*.g.dart` 부재로 빌드 fail | build_runner 산출물을 commit 안 함 + CI에서 생성 안 함 | workflow에 `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs` 단계 추가. `.gitignore`에 codegen 산출물 명시 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:57:| 6 | `dart format --set-exit-if-changed` 무한 fail | 로컬 Dart ≠ CI Flutter stable Dart (포맷 미세 차이) | `dart format --output=none ... continue-on-error: true` (advisory). 또는 `flutter --version` lock으로 환경 통일 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:58:| 7 | `dart analyze --fatal-infos` 너무 strict | `withOpacity` deprecated 같은 minor info | `--fatal-warnings`만 유지 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:64:| 8 | `Dio.post/get/fetch` + `MaterialPageRoute` type inference 14건 | analyzer `strict_raw_type` / `inference_failure_on_function_invocation` | `<Map<String, dynamic>>` / `<void>` 등 명시 type argument |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:65:| 9 | I-5에서 `<Map>[]` 재발 3건 | Map raw type literal | `<Map<String, dynamic>>[]` 명시. dart `strict-raw-types: true` analyzer 옵션 활성화 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:73:### Trigger / Workflow
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:77:| 11 | OAuth `workflow` scope 없어 `.github/workflows/**` push 거부 | gh auth token 권한 부족 | `gh auth refresh -s workflow -h github.com` + `gh auth setup-git` |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:78:| 12 | 빈 commit이 path filter trigger 안 함 | head commit에 변경 파일 없음 | 실제 변경 commit으로 trigger 또는 `gh workflow run <name>.yml` dispatch |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:79:| 13 | feature 브랜치 push에 CI 0건 trigger | workflow가 `on: push: branches: [master]` 만 | feature branch에서도 검증 필요하면 `pull_request:` trigger 추가 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:81:## 표준 workflow 템플릿
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:84:# .github/workflows/flutter.yml
