C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:126:### `flutter-version: stable` 추적은 PR-by-PR 불안정성
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:130:pubspec.lock 변경 PR마다 cache rebuild → 시간 절약 0. `cache: true` (flutter-action 내장) + 매번 fresh `pub get`이 결과적으로 빠른 경우 많음.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:135:### `flutter test integration_test/`를 unit test와 같이 돌리면 느려짐
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:136:integration_test는 emulator/desktop runner 필요 → workflow 분리. unit test는 PR마다, integration은 nightly 또는 manual dispatch.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:138:### Flutter desktop CI 시도 시 ninja-build/libgtk-3-dev 누락
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:139:Linux desktop runner에서 `flutter build linux` 또는 `flutter run -d linux`는 native 빌드 도구 필요:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:142:- run: flutter config --enable-linux-desktop
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:143:- run: xvfb-run flutter test ...   # headless display
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:146:### `withOpacity` deprecated → `withValues(alpha: ...)` migration
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:147:Flutter 3.27+에서 `Color.withOpacity(0.5)` deprecated. info-level warning이라 `--fatal-infos`면 fail. Migration:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\flutter\3.x\ci-hotfix-canon.md:150:color.withOpacity(0.5)         // deprecated, info warning
