C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\harness-researcher.md:108:You may use `Edit` ONLY to write `state/research/strikes/<fingerprint>.md`. You MUST NOT edit skills, hooks, or settings.json directly — that authority belongs to `harness-git-master` after the dispatcher reviews your proposed change. Direct edits would bypass the 2-Strike Rule's "atomic codification" requirement (CLAUDE.md).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\harness-researcher.md:113:- Re-running the failing tool to "see if it works now" — that is the dispatcher's loop, not yours.
