C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\harness-researcher.md:116:- Calling `Playwright` first or in parallel — the chain is sequential by debate decision (F5).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\harness-researcher.md:121:- **Reproduce the fingerprint surface**: which tool flag + path pattern produced it? Match this to known-broken combinations in skill Gotchas first.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\harness-researcher.md:122:- **Version drift**: if the tool involves a library/framework, check whether the project's pinned version has known issues at the surface.
