C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:361:## Vertical Slices vs Horizontal Layers
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:363:**Vertical slices (PREFER):**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:365:Plan 01: User feature (model + API + UI)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:367:Plan 03: Order feature (model + API + UI)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:371:**Horizontal layers (AVOID):**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:373:Plan 01: Create User model, Product model, Order model
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:374:Plan 02: Create User API, Product API, Order API
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:375:Plan 03: Create User UI, Product UI, Order UI
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:379:**When vertical slices work:** Features are independent, self-contained, no cross-feature dependencies.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:381:**When horizontal layers necessary:** Shared foundation required (auth before protected features), genuine type dependencies, infrastructure setup.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:383:## File Ownership for Parallel Execution
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:385:Exclusive file ownership prevents conflicts:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:388:# Plan 01 frontmatter
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:389:files_modified: [src/models/user.ts, src/api/users.ts]
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:391:# Plan 02 frontmatter (no overlap = parallel)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:395:No overlap → can run parallel. File in multiple plans → later plan depends on earlier.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:411:| Very complex (migrations) | 1-2 | ~30-40% | ~30-50% |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:420:- Discovery + implementation in same plan
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:422:**CONSIDER splitting:** >5 files total, complex domains, uncertainty about approach, natural semantic boundaries.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:432:Derive plans from actual work. Granularity determines compression tolerance, not a target. Don't pad small work to hit a number. Don't compress complex work to look efficient.
