C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:551:## Interface Context for Executors
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:553:**Key insight:** "The difference between handing a contractor blueprints versus telling them 'build me a house.'"
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:555:When creating plans that depend on existing code or create new interfaces consumed by other plans:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:558:After determining `files_modified`, extract the key interfaces/types/exports from the codebase that executors will need:
