C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:587:</interfaces>
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:590:### For plans that CREATE new interfaces:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:591:If this plan creates types/interfaces that later plans depend on, include a "Wave 0" skeleton step:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:595:  <name>Task 0: Write interface contracts</name>
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:597:  <action>Create type definitions that downstream plans will implement against. These are the contracts — implementation comes in later tasks.</action>
