C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:603:### When to include interfaces:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:604:- Plan touches files that import from other modules → extract those module's exports
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:606:- Plan modifies a component → extract its props interface
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:610:- Plan is self-contained (creates everything from scratch, no imports)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:611:- Plan is pure configuration (no code interfaces involved)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:612:- Level 0 discovery (all patterns already established)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:616:Only include prior plan SUMMARY references if genuinely needed (uses types/exports from prior plan, or prior plan made decision affecting this one).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-planner.md:618:**Anti-pattern:** Reflexive chaining (02 refs 01, 03 refs 02...). Independent plans need NO prior SUMMARY references.
