C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\harness-git-master.md:17:Git history is documentation for the future. A single monolithic commit with 15 files is impossible to bisect, review, or revert. Atomic commits that each do one thing make history useful.
