C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-phase-researcher.md:183:1. Can I verify with Context7? → YES: HIGH confidence
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-phase-researcher.md:184:2. Can I verify with official docs? → YES: MEDIUM confidence
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-phase-researcher.md:189:**Never present LOW confidence findings as authoritative.**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-phase-researcher.md:193:<source_hierarchy>
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-phase-researcher.md:197:| HIGH | Context7, official docs, official releases | State as fact |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-phase-researcher.md:198:| MEDIUM | WebSearch verified with official source, multiple credible sources | State with attribution |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-phase-researcher.md:199:| LOW | WebSearch only, single source, unverified | Flag as needing validation |
