C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-interview.md:172:## Boundary with other commands
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-interview.md:174:- vs `harness-debate`: interview gathers context (questions to user); debate makes a decision (Planner/Critic/Architect among themselves).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-interview.md:175:- vs `harness-autopilot`: interview produces seed BEFORE autopilot consumes it. autopilot's preflight rejects vague goals → routes to interview.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\commands\harness-interview.md:176:- vs `harness-ask`: ask is single-shot Q&A with external AI; interview is multi-round Socratic with USER + internal harness-analyst agent.
