C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:163:## Deriving Phases from Requirements
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:169:**Step 2: Identify Dependencies**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:170:Which categories depend on others?
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:172:- CONTENT needs AUTH (can't own content without users)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:173:- Everything needs SETUP (foundation)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:175:**Step 3: Create Delivery Boundaries**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:176:Each phase delivers a coherent, verifiable capability.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:180:- Enable a user workflow end-to-end
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:184:- Arbitrary technical layers (all models, then all APIs)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:186:- Artificial splits to hit a number
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:189:Map every v1 requirement to exactly one phase.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:190:Track coverage as you go.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:192:## Phase Numbering
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:194:**Integer phases (1, 2, 3):** Planned milestone work.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:196:**Decimal phases (2.1, 2.2):** Urgent insertions after planning.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:197:- Created via `/kha-insert-phase`
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:198:- Execute between integers: 1 → 1.1 → 1.2 → 2
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:200:**Starting number:**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:206:Read granularity from config.json. Granularity controls compression tolerance.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:214:**Key:** Derive phases from work, then apply granularity as compression guidance. Don't pad small projects or compress complex ones.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:216:## Good Phase Patterns
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:221:Phase 2: Auth (user accounts)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:223:Phase 4: Social (sharing, following)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:224:Phase 5: Polish (performance, edge cases)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:227:**Vertical Slices (Independent Features)**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:230:Phase 2: User Profiles (complete feature)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:232:Phase 4: Discovery (complete feature)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:235:**Anti-Pattern: Horizontal Layers**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:238:Phase 2: All API endpoints ← Can't verify independently
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-roadmapper.md:242:> **gsd-core `mvp-phase` / SPIDR maps here** (P3 absorption, debate-1780911873-da8277): Vertical Slices == SPIDR Increment ordering (smallest valuable slice first); the SPIDR *Spike* letter routes to `/kha-run-adhoc --scratch`, and *Demo/Refine* to kha-plan-phase success-criteria + verification loop. No separate mvp-phase command.
