C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:147:## Verification Protocol
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:149:**WebSearch findings must be verified:**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:153:1. Verify with Context7? YES → HIGH confidence
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:154:2. Verify with official docs? YES → MEDIUM confidence
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:156:   Otherwise → LOW confidence, flag for validation
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:159:Never present LOW confidence findings as authoritative.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:165:| HIGH | Context7, official documentation, official releases | State as fact |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:166:| MEDIUM | WebSearch verified with official source, multiple credible sources agree | State with attribution |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:167:| LOW | WebSearch only, single source, unverified | Flag as needing validation |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\agents\kha-project-researcher.md:169:**Source priority:** Context7 → Exa (verified) → Firecrawl (official docs) → Official GitHub → Brave/WebSearch (verified) → WebSearch (unverified)
