C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:3:description: "Reapply local modifications after a GSD update"
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:4:category: workflow
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:9:After a GSD update wipes and reinstalls files, this command merges user's previously saved local modifications back into the new version. Uses three-way comparison (pristine baseline, user-modified backup, newly installed version) to reliably distinguish user customizations from version drift.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:11:**Critical invariant:** Every file in `gsd-local-patches/` was backed up because the installer's hash comparison detected it was modified. The workflow must NEVER conclude "no custom content" for any backed-up file — that is a logical contradiction. When in doubt, classify as CONFLICT requiring user review, not SKIP.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:30:# Env overrides first — covers custom config directories used with --config-dir
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:120:after modifying any GSD workflow, command, or agent files.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:124:## Step 2: Determine baseline for three-way comparison
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:126:The quality of the merge depends on having a **pristine baseline** — the original unmodified version of each file from the pre-update GSD release. This enables three-way comparison:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:127:- **Pristine baseline** (original GSD file before any user edits)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:128:- **User's version** (backed up in `gsd-local-patches/`)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:129:- **New version** (freshly installed after update)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:131:Check for baseline sources in priority order:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:141:When `HAS_GIT=true`, use `git log` to find the commit where GSD was originally installed (before user edits). For each file, the pristine baseline can be extracted with:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:143:git -C "$CONFIG_DIR" log --diff-filter=A --format="%H" -- "{file_path}"
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:145:This gives the commit that first added the file (the install commit). Extract the pristine version:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:155:If it exists, the installer saved pristine copies at install time. Use these as the baseline.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:158:If neither git history nor pristine snapshots are available, fall back to two-way comparison — but with **strengthened heuristics** (see Step 3).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:165:**Backed up from:** v{from_version}
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:166:**Current version:** {read VERSION file}
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:168:**Merge strategy:** {three-way (git) | three-way (pristine) | two-way (enhanced)}
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:176:## Step 4: Merge each file
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:180:1. **Read the backed-up version** (user's modified copy from `gsd-local-patches/`)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:181:2. **Read the newly installed version** (current file after update)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:184:### Three-way merge (when baseline is available)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:186:Compare the three versions to isolate changes:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:187:- **User changes** = diff(pristine → user's version) — these are the customizations to preserve
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:188:- **Upstream changes** = diff(pristine → new version) — these are version updates to accept
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:190:**Merge rules:**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:191:- Sections changed only by user → apply user's version
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:192:- Sections changed only by upstream → accept upstream version
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:193:- Sections changed by both → flag as CONFLICT, show both, ask user
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:194:- Sections unchanged by either → use new version (identical to all three)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:196:### Two-way merge (fallback when no baseline)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:200:**CRITICAL RULE: Every file in this backup directory was explicitly detected as modified by the installer's SHA-256 hash comparison. "No custom content" is never a valid conclusion.**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:203:a. Read both versions completely
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:204:b. Identify ALL differences, then classify each as:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:205:   - **Mechanical drift** — path substitutions (e.g. `/Users/xxx/.claude/` → `$HOME/.claude/`), variable additions (`${GSD_WS}`, `${AGENT_SKILLS_*}`), error handling additions (`|| true`)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:206:   - **User customization** — added steps/sections, removed sections, reordered content, changed behavior, added frontmatter fields, modified instructions
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:208:c. **If ANY differences remain after filtering out mechanical drift → those are user customizations. Merge them.**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:209:d. **If ALL differences appear to be mechanical drift → still flag as CONFLICT.** The installer's hash check already proved this file was modified. Ask the user: "This file appears to only have path/variable differences. Were there intentional customizations?" Do NOT silently skip.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:211:### Git-enhanced two-way merge
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:213:When the config directory is a git repo but the pristine install commit can't be found, use commit history to identify user changes:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:216:git -C "$CONFIG_DIR" log --oneline --no-merges -- "{file_path}" | grep -v "gsd:update\|GSD update\|gsd-install"
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:218:Each matching commit represents an intentional user modification. Use the commit messages and diffs to understand what was changed and why.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-reapply-local-patches\SKILL.md:220:4. **Write merged result** to the installed location
