C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-workstream-manager\SKILL.md:96:- `kha-settings` vs `kha-set-model-profile` vs `kha-user-profile`: `kha-settings`는 전체 workflow toggle과 defaults 저장을 다루는 interactive config surface다. `kha-set-model-profile`는 quality/balanced/budget/inherit 계열의 agent routing profile fast-path다. `kha-user-profile`는 세션 분석으로 `USER-PROFILE.md`와 개인화 artifact를 만드는 behavioral profile surface다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-workstream-manager\SKILL.md:98:- `kha-milestone-manager` vs `kha-list-workspaces` vs `kha-workstream-manager`: `kha-milestone-manager`는 milestone 안의 여러 phase를 interactive하게 orchestration하는 command center다. `kha-list-workspaces`는 `~/gsd-workspaces/`를 읽기 전용으로 나열한다. `kha-workstream-manager`는 `.planning/workstreams/`의 create/switch/status/progress/complete lifecycle을 관리한다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-workstream-manager\SKILL.md:101:- `kha-self-update`: dry-run은 installed/latest/changelog/install-scope preview, snapshot은 runtime target과 `gsd-local-patches/` backup, confirm은 explicit proceed gate로 정의했다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-workstream-manager\SKILL.md:102:- `kha-sync-docs`: dry-run은 queue/mode/path preview, snapshot은 `.planning/tmp/docs-work-manifest.json` 및 `verify-*.json`, confirm은 generation proceed와 secret-scan commit gate로 정의했다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-workstream-manager\SKILL.md:103:- `kha-milestone-manager`: dry-run은 dashboard와 compound action preview, snapshot은 현재 disk state로 재구성한 phase table, confirm은 action selection before dispatch로 정의했다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-workstream-manager\SKILL.md:105:- `kha-workstream-manager`: dry-run은 current active/mode/target preview, snapshot은 `workstream list/status/get` 상태, confirm은 create/switch/complete 전 gate로 정의했다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kha-workstream-manager\SKILL.md:106:- `kha-intel-index`: dry-run은 `status`/`diff` 기반 rebuild preview, snapshot은 refresh 전 intel freshness/diff state, confirm은 explicit refresh approval로 정의했다.
