C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kotlin\2.0.x\k2-default-migration-kapt-ksp-and-compiler-plugin-lockstep.md:46:4. stability 설정은 `composeCompiler { stabilityConfigurationFile = ... }` 또는 plugin DSL.
