C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\kotlin\android\workmanager-room-datastore-and-background-execution-guardrails.md:33:6. **input/output Data 크기 제한 10KB** — 큰 데이터는 file/DB 거쳐 reference만 전달.
