C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:7:patterns: spring-boot 4 jarmode=tools layered-jar buildpack paketo dependencies application
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:14:# Efficient Packaging (Boot 4)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:16:> 컨테이너 이미지에서 가장 자주 바뀌는 건 application class. 가장 안 바뀌는 건 dependency jar. 한 layer 에 다 넣으면 코드 한 줄 바꿔도 전체 layer 가 invalidate 된다. Boot 4 의 `jarmode=tools` + layered Dockerfile / buildpack 으로 둘을 분리한다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:21:1. **packaging path 선택**: Dockerfile vs Cloud Native Buildpacks (Paketo). 둘 다 Boot 4 reference 가 1급 시민으로 다룸.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:22:   - Dockerfile: 명시적 제어, 조직 표준 base image 강제 가능, layer 정책을 직접 작성.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:24:2. **layered jar 활성화 확인** — Boot 3 부터 default. `BOOT-INF/layers.idx` 가 jar 안에 생기는지 확인. 안 만들어지면 plugin 설정 점검.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:25:3. **layer 정책**: `dependencies` / `spring-boot-loader` / `snapshot-dependencies` / `application` 4단 분리가 표준. application 만 자주 바뀌도록.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:27:### IF Dockerfile 작성 (Implement)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:28:1. **builder stage 에서 `java -Djarmode=tools -jar app.jar extract --layers --launcher`** — 4.x 의 권장 추출 모드. layer 단위 디렉토리로 풀린다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:29:2. **각 layer 를 별도 `COPY` 로 따로 이미지에 추가** — dependencies 먼저, application 마지막. Docker 가 자동으로 layer 단위 캐싱.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:31:4. **ENTRYPOINT 는 추출된 launcher** — `java -jar my-app/my-app.jar` 또는 `java org.springframework.boot.loader.launch.JarLauncher`.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:33:```dockerfile
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:34:# Builder
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:35:FROM eclipse-temurin:17-jdk AS builder
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\java\springboot-4\efficient-packaging.md:38:RUN java -Djarmode=tools -jar my-app.jar extract --layers --launcher
