C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:14:# React Native — OTA, Runtime Version, Rollback & Binary Compat Contracts
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:16:OTA (Over-the-Air) 업데이트 — EAS Update, CodePush, expo-updates — 는 **JS 번들만 교체할 뿐 native 코드/아키텍처는 못 바꾼다.** OTA의 사고 패턴은 거의 항상 **(1) 변경에 native 변경이 섞였는데도 OTA로 push, (2) runtime version 정책 부재로 구버전 binary가 신버전 JS를 받아 crash, (3) rollback 경로 미설계, (4) public env에 secret 누출, (5) deep link/auth가 OTA 채널과 맞물리며 깨짐**이다. 이 스킬은 그 계약을 라인 단위로 강제한다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:21:1. **JS-only 변경 = OTA 가능** — JS, TS, asset (이미지, JSON), JS 의존성 (peer dep 추가 없이).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:24:4. **Hermes on/off** — bytecode 변경. OTA 불가.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:25:5. **`expo-updates` SDK runtime API 차이** — OTA 가능하지만 runtime version으로 차단된 채널인지 확인.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:27:### IF runtime version 정책 (Plan)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:28:1. **`runtimeVersion` 명시 필수** — `appVersion` (1.x.x → 1.x.x은 호환), `sdkVersion` (Expo SDK), `policy: "appVersion"`/`"nativeVersion"`/`"fingerprint"` 등 명시.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:29:2. **native 변경 시 runtime version bump 필수** — 안 하면 구버전 binary가 신JS를 받아 crash. **CI에 enforcement.**
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:30:3. **fingerprint 방식 (Expo SDK 51+)** — native fingerprint 자동 계산. 변경 감지 누락 위험 줄어듬.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:31:4. **CodePush의 `targetBinaryVersion`** — semver range. native 변경 시 range 좁히기.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:35:2. **internal preview는 internal binary에만** — external user에게 노출 금지.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:36:3. **rollout 단계** — 0% → 10% → 50% → 100%. 단계마다 crash rate / error rate 확인.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:37:4. **channel switch 검증** — TestFlight/Internal Track에서 실제 OTA fetch 확인.
