C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\ota-runtime-version-rollback-and-binary-compat-contracts.md:47:2. **secret = server side만** — 토큰 발급은 서버에서. JS는 발급된 토큰만 받음.
