C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:14:# Expo Prebuild, Config Plugin, Native Diff Discipline
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:16:Expo 0.76.x+ 시대의 React Native는 **CNG(Continuous Native Generation) + config plugin**을 통한 native code 생성이 표준이다. 이 흐름을 깨면 ① iOS/Android 한쪽만 동작 ② OTA로 native 변경이 배포 ③ Xcode/Gradle 직수정이 prebuild에서 사라짐 같은 사고가 난다. 이 스킬은 prebuild·plugin·native diff 세 경계를 라인 단위로 잡는다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:21:1. **CNG (Continuous Native Generation)** — `app.config.ts` + config plugins로 모든 native 설정. `npx expo prebuild`로 ios/android 폴더 생성. 기본 권장.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:22:2. **Bare workflow** (전통적 직편집) — ios/android 폴더 직접 관리. CNG 안 씀. 마이그레이션 어려운 기존 RN 앱.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:28:2. **Android Manifest / Gradle** → `withAndroidManifest` / `withGradleProperties` / `withAppBuildGradle`.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:29:3. **여러 단계 변환 + 위험** → `withDangerousMod` (마지막 수단). 후속 plugin이 실행되지 않으니 신중.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:30:4. **표준화된 권한**: `app.config.ts`의 `ios.infoPlist`, `android.permissions` 사용.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:39:### IF runtimeVersion 정책 (Migrate / Implement)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:40:1. **`runtimeVersion`은 native binary의 식별자** — JS 번들과 native가 호환되는지 결정.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:41:2. native 변경 (plugin 추가, SDK 업데이트, Expo SDK upgrade) → **runtimeVersion bump 필수**. 안 하면 OTA로 호환 안 되는 JS 배포.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:42:3. JS-only 변경 → runtimeVersion 그대로 → OTA 안전.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:43:4. policy 옵션: `"appVersion"`(version 따라감), `"sdkVersion"`(Expo SDK 따라감), `"fingerprint"`(자동 — 권장), 직접 문자열.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:44:5. fingerprint 사용 시 plugin이 자동 hash — 새 plugin 추가하면 자동 새 buildable.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\react-native\expo-prebuild-config-plugin-and-native-diff-discipline.md:50:4. native folder를 커밋하는 경우 `bare` workflow로 마이그레이션 검토.
