C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:15:# Distributed Cache Decisions (Cassandra / EVCache / Redis / DynamoDB)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:17:> 핵심: 4 종류 store는 일관성/지속성/접근 패턴이 모두 다름. **Cassandra는 "per-operation tradeoff"**, EVCache는 AP, Redis는 단일 노드(또는 cluster), DynamoDB는 managed AP+option strong read. 가장 흔한 사고는 **hot partition** — Cassandra/DynamoDB 둘 다 partition key 분포 안 보고 설계해 throughput cliff.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:32:2. clustering key — partition 내 정렬. range scan 패턴 결정
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:34:4. compaction — STCS (write-heavy) vs LCS (read-heavy) vs TWCS (time-series)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:40:2. persistence — AOF (durability) vs RDB (faster restart). 둘 다 가능
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:41:3. cluster mode — 16384 hash slot. cross-slot transaction 불가
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:42:4. memory budget — `maxmemory` 명시 + alert at 75%
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:55:### IF cache stampede / thundering herd (Debug)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:57:2. jittered TTL — exact 만료 시각 분산 (TTL ± 10% random)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:65:- DynamoDB adaptive capacity는 partition cap 자동 우회 안 함 — burst 흡수만.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:66:- Dynomite는 redis 자체가 아니라 redis 위 multi-DC replication shim — vanilla Redis Cluster와 실패 모드 다름.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\distributed-cache-decisions.md:76:| 신뢰성 | EVCache multi-AZ replication, Redis AOF persistence |
