C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:14:# iOS — Entitlements, Universal Links, Keychain & Privacy Surface Review
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:16:iOS의 Info.plist / .entitlements / PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy / AASA / Keychain 설정은 **단순 메타가 아니라 권한·보안·배포 계약**이다. 사고의 전형 패턴: (1) 더 이상 사용 안 하는 capability/usage string이 잔존 → App Store 거부, (2) URL scheme/Universal Link로 인증 bypass, (3) Keychain accessibility 잘못 설정으로 첫 잠금해제 전 데이터 노출, (4) NSAppTransportSecurity 광범위 예외, (5) PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy 누락된 API access. 이 스킬은 그 surface를 라인 단위로 강제한다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:22:2. **Associated Domains** (`applinks:`/`webcredentials:`/`activitycontinuation:`) — Universal Link, Shared Web Credentials, Handoff 각각 별도. 필요한 것만.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:26:### IF Universal Link 채택 (Plan)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:27:1. **Associated Domains에 `applinks:example.com`**. wildcard 가능하나 좁게.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:28:2. **AASA 파일** `https://example.com/.well-known/apple-app-site-association` — `application/json` MIME, **redirect 없이 200**, **SSL 인증서 valid**. CDN cache 정책 검증.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:29:3. **paths 명시** — `"paths": ["/orders/*", "/cart/*"]`. wildcard `["*"]`는 운영 체크 어려워짐.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:33:1. **모든 진입점은 untrusted input 가정** — query/fragment 검증 + 화이트리스트.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:35:3. **modal stacking 정책** — deep link로 진입 시 기존 modal 정리 / 유지 정책 명시. 흐름이 잠기는 incident 1순위.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:39:1. **`kSecAttrAccessible` 명시** — default를 신뢰하지 말 것. 권장: `kSecAttrAccessibleAfterFirstUnlockThisDeviceOnly` (백업 안 됨, device 잠금해제 후만).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:40:2. **biometric 보호 데이터** → `SecAccessControlCreateWithFlags` + `.biometryCurrentSet` 또는 `.userPresence`. Face/Touch ID 등록 변경 시 invalidate.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:41:3. **`kSecAttrService` + `kSecAttrAccount`** 명확. 같은 키 두 번 add 시 `errSecDuplicateItem` — update flow 별도.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:52:2. **사용자 친화 문구** — "왜 이 권한이 필요한가"를 사용자 시각으로. 개발용 placeholder 금지.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:53:3. **PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy** (Privacy Manifest) — Apple이 요구하는 reason API access (UserDefaults, file timestamp 등) + tracking + collected data type. 누락 시 App Store 경고/거부.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:58:2. **`scene(_:continue:)`** — Universal Link / Handoff 진입. validated URL인지 검증 후 navigate.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\mobile\ios\entitlements-universal-links-keychain-and-privacy-surface-review.md:59:3. **`NSUserActivity` 기반 restoration** — `userActivity?.webpageURL` 검증.
