C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\workflow-orchestration.md:17:> 핵심: workflow 코드 = **deterministic replay from event history**. activity = side effect (idempotent). 가장 흔한 사고는 **non-determinism** — `Date.now()`/`Math.random()`/native `setTimeout` 직접 사용 시 replay 불일치. metaflow(ML)와 직교 — 일반 microservice business workflow.
