C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:4:keywords: 디자인이론 design-theory 커리큘럼 curriculum 바우하우스 bauhaus 게슈탈트 gestalt 스위스스타일 swiss-style 그리드 grid 디자인싱킹 design-thinking double-diamond 디자인스프린트 atomic-design rams 색채 itten albers 타이포그래피 meggs canon 안목 taste 크리틱 critique mobbin 레퍼런스
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:7:patterns:
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:17:> 모델이 결여한 건 **lived experience(안목)** — 그래서 curated 레퍼런스·명시적 제약·크리틱 루프로 *공급*해야지 저절로 emerge하지 않는다.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:22:- **문제가 흐릿(0→1)** → Design Thinking(Empathize→Define→Ideate→Prototype→Test, d.school/IDEO) 또는 **Double Diamond** Discover.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:23:- **전체 여정 지도 필요 + 잘못된 문제 방지** → **Double Diamond**(Discover→Define‖Develop→Deliver). 핵심 규율: **해결책 전에 문제 발산**.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:24:- **빠른 검증 결정 필요** → **Design Sprint 5일**(Map→Sketch→Decide→Prototype→Test w/5명).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:30:- **Rams 10원칙**("less, but better"): 혁신적·유용·미적·이해가능하게·눈에안띔·정직·오래감·마지막 디테일까지 철저·환경친화·가능한 한 최소 디자인.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:32:- **Norman 6**(일상의 디자인): affordance(무엇이 가능)·signifier(어디서/어떻게)·constraint·mapping·feedback·conceptual model.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:33:- **Tognazzini First Principles**: anticipation·autonomy·defaults·explorable·latency reduction·protect users' work·track state 등(Nielsen과 병행 heuristic eval).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:49:- **Phase 0 파운데이션**: 2D(선/형/명도/색/질감/공간 + 균형/대비/리듬/강조/통일/위계) · 3D/form · 관찰 드로잉 · 게슈탈트+figure-ground · **색채**(Itten 12색환+7대비 / **Albers *Interaction of Color* 종이 연습** — 색은 상대적, "3색을 2색으로 보이게").
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:50:- **Phase 1 타이포 literacy**: 자소 해부/분류 → 측정(leading/kerning/tracking) → 위계/그루핑 → **그리드(Müller-Brockmann *Grid Systems*: manuscript/column/modular/baseline)** → 표현적→체계적→에디토리얼.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:52:- **Phase 3 트랙**: 그래픽(브랜딩/에디토리얼/포스터/print production/모션) 또는 인터랙션/UX(HCI 인지→스케치/와이어/프로토→유저리서치/사용성→정보디자인+service blueprint→캡스톤).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:57:- **실제 프로덕션 UI**(사용성 검증됨): **Mobbin**(모바일+웹 플로우), **Refero**(SaaS/웹 페이지타입별) — UX 리서치용.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:59:- **컴포넌트 패턴**: Collect UI. **접근성 구현**: Heydon Pickering *Inclusive Components*.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\design-foundations.md:65:| Don Norman | affordance·signifier·mapping·feedback (*Design of Everyday Things*), NN/g 공동창립 |
