C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:98:□ circuit open 시 즉시 fallback
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:105:A → B → C 호출 chain에서 A가 5s deadline이면 B는 4s, C는 3s 식으로 전파. gRPC는 metadata로 자동 전파(`grpc-timeout`). HTTP는 직접 header 또는 framework 설정. propagation 없으면 A는 끊겼는데 B/C는 계속 일하는 좀비 호출.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:111:### Circuit Breaker State Machine
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:115:임계: consecutive N개 또는 N초 안 error rate %.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:118:HTTP/1.1은 pool 여러 connection으로 concurrency. HTTP/2는 1개 connection에 multiplex. pool max=1로도 충분 — 옛 HTTP/1.1 sizing 그대로 두면 자원 낭비. 단 stream concurrency limit(server max_streams)은 별개.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:120:### DNS TTL과 Failover
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:121:JVM 등 일부 런타임은 DNS 결과를 영원 캐시(default `networkaddress.cache.ttl=-1`). host가 다른 IP로 failover 됐는데 영원 옛 IP 호출 → 장애. TTL 30-60s로 명시 또는 매 connection마다 resolve.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:124:gRPC client default deadline은 보통 무한 — production에선 항상 명시. server는 deadline 받아서 자기 쿼리/호출에도 전파. 안 그러면 client가 끊겼는데 server DB 쿼리 계속 도는 좀비.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:135:실패 → 즉시 retry → 더 실패 → server overload 가속. exponential + jitter 필수. jitter 없으면 thundering herd(모든 client 동시에 retry).
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:137:### Circuit breaker가 너무 sensitive
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:138:임계가 낮으면 transient blip마다 open → user 영향. 보통 consecutive 5-10 또는 error rate 50% over 10s. tuning이 필요.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:141:pool unbounded면 갑자기 traffic 폭증 시 connection 수만 → server가 못 받음 → 모두 실패. max + queue로 backpressure.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:143:### Idle connection이 server에서 끊김
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:144:LB / server가 idle 60s에 끊는데 client pool은 5분 보관 → 다음 사용 때 broken pipe. server keepalive 확인 + client idle timeout < server.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:146:### DNS caching forever
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:147:한 번 resolve된 IP를 process 평생 사용 → host migration / failover 시 stuck. JVM `networkaddress.cache.ttl=30`, OS-level은 stub resolver TTL 존중.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:150:downstream이 느려서 모두 timeout → 모두 retry → 더 느려짐 → 영원 storm. circuit breaker + retry budget으로 차단.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:153:client가 5s deadline에 끊기지만 server는 모르고 계속 처리 → DB lock / resource 점유. 모든 호출에 deadline 전파.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:159:multi-region failover 후에도 옛 region 연결 사용 → cross-region latency. 정기 connection cycling 또는 TTL 기반 refresh.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:162:hedged 보낸 요청이 둘 다 server에 도착 → 비idempotent면 중복. hedged는 항상 idempotent + cancel 신호 또는 idempotency-key.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:170:- circuit breaker 상태: 라이브러리별 metric (resilience4j, polly, hystrix 대시보드)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\transport-reliability.md:171:- DNS TTL: JVM `networkaddress.cache.ttl`, OS resolver 설정
