C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\toolchain-reproducibility.md:152:### Cache mount 없이 devcontainer rebuild
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\toolchain-reproducibility.md:156:local에서 `npm install` 자유로 → lockfile drift → CI에서 깨짐. local도 `npm ci`로 install (또는 hook).
