C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\messaging-governance.md:146:- `_common/durable-execution.md` — Temporal activity가 메시지 consumer 패턴의 deterministic 변종
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\messaging-governance.md:147:- `data/flink-streaming-job-shape.md` — Kafka source `withIdleness()` 의무화, Iceberg sink upsert
