C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:17:> 핵심: 과부하 시 **모든 요청 균등 거부 X** — criticality tier별로 우선순위 결정. Netflix가 Zuul gateway에 priority threshold 패턴 정착시켜 2020 + 2024 article 두 편으로 산업 표준화. retry storm 차단을 회피용 503보다 **calculated drop**이 정답.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:22:1. criticality tier 정의 (3-5단계):
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:23:   - **Tier 1 (사용자 결제/재생)**: 절대 drop 금지
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:24:   - **Tier 2 (사용자 탐색/검색)**: 과부하 후반 drop
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:25:   - **Tier 3 (백그라운드 sync, 알림)**: 과부하 초반 drop
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:26:   - **Tier 4 (analytics, 로깅)**: 부하 감지 즉시 drop
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:27:2. priority 라벨 — request header `X-Request-Priority: 1-4` 또는 endpoint별 tier 매핑 테이블
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:28:3. shedding decision point — edge gateway (Zuul/Envoy) 또는 service entry. **둘 중 하나만** (이중 차단 시 cascading)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:31:1. signal — concurrent request count, queue depth, p99 latency, error rate (어느 한 임계 초과 시)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:32:2. **stepwise threshold**: 75% 부하 → tier 4 drop, 85% → tier 3 drop, 95% → tier 2 drop. tier 1은 마지막 보루
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:33:3. response code — drop 대상에 **503 Service Unavailable + `Retry-After`** 헤더. 429 (rate limit)와 구분
