C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:44:2. caller 측은 exponential backoff + jitter
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:45:3. tier 1 trafic은 retry budget 큼, tier 4는 retry budget 0 (Envoy `budget_percent`로)
