C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:62:| 기능 적합성 | tier 1은 절대 drop X — 결제/재생 critical path 보장 |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:64:| 호환성 | 표준 503 + `Retry-After` 헤더 — RFC 7231 compatible |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:65:| 사용성 | header 1개 (`X-Request-Priority`)로 caller 분류 |
