C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:77:### Drop 응답에 `Retry-After` 누락
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:78:caller 즉시 재시도 → retry storm. always `Retry-After: <seconds>` 또는 `Retry-After: <HTTP-date>`.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:80:### Edge + service 양쪽 ignore-coupled
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:81:edge가 drop했는데 service도 drop 시도 → cascading. 한 layer만 drop, 다른 layer는 pass-through.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\load-shedding-prioritized.md:83:### Hysteresis 없는 단순 임계
