C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:15:# Service Resilience Patterns (resilience4j 2.x)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:17:> 핵심: Hystrix는 2018부터 maintenance mode (Netflix 자체 발표), 신규 채택 금지. resilience4j 2.x가 산업 표준. 가장 흔한 실패는 **aspect order** — Retry가 CircuitBreaker 바깥에 있으면 OPEN 상태도 retry하여 storm 발생.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:24:| 응답 latency 가변·downstream 죽음 | **CircuitBreaker** |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:25:| transient 실패 (5xx, network blip) | **Retry** (지수 backoff + jitter 필수) |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:26:| 동시 호출 폭주로 caller 자원 고갈 | **Bulkhead** |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:27:| 외부 SLA 호출 한도 | **RateLimiter** |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:28:| 응답 무한 대기 | **TimeLimiter** (CompletableFuture 필요) |
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:30:### IF CircuitBreaker tuning (Implement)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:31:1. default: `failureRateThreshold=50%`, `slidingWindowSize=100`, `minimumNumberOfCalls=100`, `waitDurationInOpenState=60s`, `permittedNumberOfCallsInHalfOpenState=10`
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:32:2. **low-traffic endpoint** → `minimumNumberOfCalls`를 5–20으로 낮추기 (default 100이면 트립 안 됨)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:33:3. **slow call**도 failure로 간주 → `slowCallDurationThreshold` + `slowCallRateThreshold` 설정 또는 TimeLimiter 결합
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:34:4. downstream 복구 시간 가변이면 → `waitIntervalFunctionInOpenState`로 exponential backoff (60s 고정값 flapping 방지)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:38:2. blocking I/O를 caller thread와 분리 + queue buffering → `ThreadPoolBulkhead` (CompletableFuture 필수)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:39:3. **`@CircuitBreaker` + `ThreadPoolBulkhead` 직접 결합 금지** — 동기 메서드에 같이 붙이면 런타임 에러. async chain으로 구성
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:41:### IF aspect order 결정 (Implement)
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:42:1. default 순서: `Retry( CircuitBreaker( RateLimiter( TimeLimiter( Bulkhead( Function ) ) ) ) )` — Retry가 가장 바깥
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:43:2. 위 default는 **retry storm** 위험 — CB가 OPEN으로 `CallNotPermittedException` 던지면 Retry가 재시도
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\service-resilience-patterns.md:44:3. 해결: `retryExceptions`에서 `CallNotPermittedException` 명시 제외, **또는** `retryAspectOrder`를 `circuitBreakerAspectOrder`보다 낮게 설정 (Retry를 CB 안쪽에)
