C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\self-improve.md:46:  - approach_family = 모든 plan에 하나 태그: architecture · training_config · data · infrastructure · optimization · testing · documentation · other.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\self-improve.md:48:2. **Critic Review**: `harness-critic` 이 H001/H002/H003 + data contract 스키마 + history awareness 를 강제. `critic_approved: false` 는 실행 제외.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\self-improve.md:53:2. **Pre-merge safety (mandatory)**: `git status --porcelain` empty (clean tree). Non-empty → abort iteration with `aborted_dirty_tree`; never auto-stash. merge 전에 `git tag improve-snapshot-{n}`.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\self-improve.md:54:3. `status: "success"` 만 필터링. 0개면 Record 단계로. `benchmark_score`로 랭크 (`benchmark_direction` 존중) → 최상위부터: no-regression 체크 → `--no-ff` merge → merged 상태에서 re-benchmark → 확인되면 winner 수락.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\self-improve.md:55:4. 회귀면 `git reset --merge improve-snapshot-{n}` (비파괴 복구) 후 다음 candidate. `git reset --hard`는 사용 금지. Merge conflict면 `git merge --abort` 후 다음 candidate.
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\self-improve.md:56:5. Winner publication — **default off**. `auto_push: true` 명시 + clean tree + remote snapshot 일치, 셋 모두일 때만 push. 아니면 `winner_unpublished`로 보고.
