C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\oncall-and-incident-response.md:82:### single-burn-rate alert만 운영
C:\Users\rudtn\zeus\.runtime\absorption\sources\baldrix\pinned\skills\_common\oncall-and-incident-response.md:83:short window 단독 → false positive 폭증 (alert fatigue). long window 단독 → MTTR 길어짐. 1h+5m 단축 + 6h+30m 장기 + 3d+6h 티켓 3-tier 필수 (Google SRE Workbook).
